  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Cut the eggplant into 3.5cm-thick wedges. Cut half the lemon into wedges. Quarter the tomatoes. Finely chop the parsley, including the stems. Coarsely chop the pistachios.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/242515/photos/large/prep_ingredients-640602237c30c8fe52f7aae4270b0ab1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast eggplant: Put the eggplant on the lined tray, lightly spray or brush with olive oil, season with salt and pepper, then roast for 20 mins or until golden and tender. Add the pepitas and pistachios to the tray with the eggplant. Roast for a further 5 mins or until toasted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/242516/photos/large/roast_eggplant-84c15ad6d99f6c07303f2202c009a077.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook freekeh: Meanwhile, put the freekeh in a medium saucepan with 1L (4 cups) water and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to medium and cook, partially covered, for 15-18 mins until tender. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/242517/photos/large/cook_freekeh-10dc3c1f9602f3b105009126b571682a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make dressing: Put 2 tbs olive oil, 1 tbs red wine vinegar and 1 tsp honey in a large bowl. Season with salt and pepper and whisk to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/242518/photos/large/make_dressing-7256dbaff47364a87b75ce325ec25621.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Add the freekeh, tomato, parsley, pepitas and pistachios to the dressing and toss to combine. Divide the tabouleh and eggplant among plates. Serve with the lemon wedges to squeeze over. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/242519/photos/large/serve_up-d19b34bd16041de91438ed0055b58365.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you have some Greek or natural yoghurt in your fridge, drizzle it over the eggplant for an authentic touch.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/242520/photos/large/make_it_yours-043c9eae51a98cfad714c6f460f1c03d.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
